WEBVTT

00:06:59.169 --> 00:07:01.856
And after that -- that red ray ...

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.647
we can never be the same.

00:07:05.665 --> 00:07:09.204
(Singing) A red ray

00:07:09.228 --> 00:07:10.481
[A man hunt in Georgia]

00:07:10.505 --> 00:07:12.435
cut across my desk

00:07:12.459 --> 00:07:14.648
[Mob after Hose;
he will be lynched if caught]

00:07:14.672 --> 00:07:16.918
the very day

00:07:16.942 --> 00:07:20.224
Sam's hands were laid to rest.

00:07:21.974 --> 00:07:28.951
Can words alone withstand the laws unjust?

00:07:28.975 --> 00:07:30.263
[Escape seems impossible]